{"duration_api_ms":186184,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"1fbb8f05-8fba-43ce-9c4c-51adb42f3678","total_cost_usd":0.24381199999999997,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15337,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":18246,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":12118},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15337,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":18246,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15337,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15337},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":18246,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":15337,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.24381199999999997,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":12118,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"observation\":\"All 9 feasible non-dominated designs sit on one curve at cone 70 deg, b 1.1-1.25, D 3.25-3.38 m, with only the entry angle varying. Heat flux runs 250k to 288k W/m2 and bondline temperature 422 to 394 K as the entry gets steeper. Round 3 lost all 19 evaluations to invalid geometry, because it used b=1.35 and b=1.3 at cone 70. The failure messages give a fore-cone length deficit that is linear in nose radius: -33.812 mm at b=1.35 and -12.805 mm at b=1.3 (D=3.375). That is a slope of 0.1245 mm per mm of nose radius, which equals cos70/tan70, so the model is consistent. The deficit reaches zero at b of about 1.2695 for D=3.375, and b=1.25 has already built at D 3.25-3.45. Peak g is about 12 at gamma near -3.6. The mass-fraction margin falls about 0.58-0.6 per metre of D and zero is near D=3.388 at b=1.25.\",\"evidence\":[\"C-e8cf251744f0: D=3.38, b=1.25, cone 70, gamma -3.5 is feasible with g margin 0.0136 and mass margin 0.0046. It is the corner of the feasible region.\",\"C-2439bd64c673: D=3.45, b=1.25 has mass margin -0.037, so D above about 3.388 is infeasible.\",\"C-6fbbc439e70d (b=1.3, -12.805 mm) and C-8a3c7e034331 (D=3.3, b=1.35, -33.061 mm) show the geometry failure is linear in nose radius and has a small D dependence of about -10 mm per m. That puts the b limit near 1.269.\",\"C-b49265f1a558, C-9f787a9a1c79, C-3a1c0a2c81ce, C-ed0654b17260, C-688d3d0406c7, C-a51f1ded896c: after normalising to D=3.384, q rises about 20-26k W/m2 per degree of steepening (roughly 240k at -1.55 to 288k at -3.5). T falls from about 420 K to 394 K.\",\"C-ffcd43d3a722 (g=12.219 at gamma -3.8) and C-e8cf251744f0 (g=11.837 at -3.5) put the g limit of 12 at about gamma -3.6.\"],\"mechanism\":\"Larger D lowers the ballistic coefficient and raises nose radius, which lowers both peak flux and heat load. Larger b lowers heat flux weakly (about b^-0.2). Steeper entry shortens the heat pulse and lowers bondline temperature but raises peak flux and g. So both objectives improve with D and b up to the mass-fraction and geometry limits, and the front is traced by gamma alone. I propose sweeping gamma from -1.5 to -3.58 at the corner D=3.384 (mass margin about 0.002). I alternate b=1.25, which is known to build, with b=1.265, which by the linear geometry relation leaves about +1.9 mm of cone length. This fills the front densely and extends it to steeper entry, where bondline temperature is lowest.\",\"uncertainty\":\"The b=1.265 geometry margin is an extrapolation of a linear fit (about 1.9 mm of slack). If it fails, only the alternating b=1.265 slots are lost. The mass margin at D=3.384 is about 0.002, so small model errors could flip it. Steep points at gamma -3.55 and -3.58 have a predicted g margin of only 0.3-0.7%. The q and T predictions come from interpolating normalised data using assumed D^-1.5 and b^-0.2 scalings, so absolute errors of about 1-2% in q and 1-2 K in T are plausible.\",\"proposals\":[{\"parent_id\":\"C-b49265f1a558\",\"rationale\":\"Shallow end of the front at the maximum D and b, which should dominate C-b49265f1a558 (D=3.3).\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":239900,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":420.6,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Extends the front to lower heat flux; T is about 420 K, safely below the 450 K limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-b49265f1a558\",\"rationale\":\"Tests b=1.265 (geometry slack about +1.9 mm) at D=3.384 in the shallow regime.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.265,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.6},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":241400,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":418.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Checks the linear geometry-limit extrapolation and gives a slightly better q.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-b49265f1a558\",\"rationale\":\"Front-filling point at known-safe b=1.25 and the corner D.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.7},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":243800,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":417.3,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills the front between -1.55 and -1.8 with a larger D.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-9f787a9a1c79\",\"rationale\":\"Increase D from 3.3 to 3.384 and b from 1.2 to 1.265 at the same gamma region.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.265,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.8},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":245500,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":415.6,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Should dominate C-9f787a9a1c79 (257650 W/m2, 418.0 K).\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-9f787a9a1c79\",\"rationale\":\"Front-filling point with b=1.25.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.9},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":248400,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":414.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Dense coverage of the trade-off curve at the corner D.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-01fb755d19bd\",\"rationale\":\"Replaces the b=1.1 point at gamma -2.0 with the maximal D and b.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.265,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":250100,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":412.7,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"C-01fb755d19bd has 266790 W/m2 and 415.6 K, so this should dominate it clearly.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-3a1c0a2c81ce\",\"rationale\":\"Front-filling point at gamma -2.1, b=1.25.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.1},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":253000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":410.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Interpolates the trade-off between the -2.0 and -2.2 points.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-3a1c0a2c81ce\",\"rationale\":\"Upgrade of C-3a1c0a2c81ce (D=3.3, b=1.2, -2.2) to the corner D and b=1.265.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.265,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.2},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":254700,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":409.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Should improve on the existing point at (267220, 411.8).\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-20a2b23043ee\",\"rationale\":\"Upgrade of C-20a2b23043ee (D=3.25) to D=3.384 at similar gamma.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.35},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":259000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":407.3,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Should dominate C-20a2b23043ee (273670, 411.1) through the D gain.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-ed0654b17260\",\"rationale\":\"Upgrade of C-ed0654b17260 (D=3.3, b=1.2, -2.5) to D=3.384, b=1.265.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.265,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":261900,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":405.2,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Improves on (274780, 407.6).\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-ed0654b17260\",\"rationale\":\"Mid-front point at gamma -2.65, b=1.25.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.65},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":266300,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":403.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills the gap between -2.5 and -2.8.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-688d3d0406c7\",\"rationale\":\"Upgrade of C-688d3d0406c7 (D=3.35, b=1.2, -2.8) to D=3.384, b=1.265.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.265,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.8},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":269500,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":401.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Improves on (276440, 402.7).\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-688d3d0406c7\",\"rationale\":\"Front-filling point at gamma -2.95, b=1.25.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.95},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":273900,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":399.8,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills the gap between -2.8 and -3.2 where the existing points are sparse.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a51f1ded896c\",\"rationale\":\"Front-filling point at gamma -3.1, b=1.265.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.265,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.1},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":276900,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":398.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Interpolates between the -2.8 and -3.2 points at a larger D.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a51f1ded896c\",\"rationale\":\"Upgrade of C-a51f1ded896c (D=3.35, b=1.2, -3.2) to the corner D at gamma -3.25.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.25},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":281400,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":396.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Expected to dominate (286710, 398.05).\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a51f1ded896c\",\"rationale\":\"Steep-end point at gamma -3.35 with b=1.265; g about 11.5.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.265,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.35},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":283300,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":395.3,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the steep end where T improves toward the g limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-e8cf251744f0\",\"rationale\":\"Steep-end point at gamma -3.42, b=1.25; g about 11.7.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.42},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":285800,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.7,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Close to the known-feasible C-e8cf251744f0, with a small D increase.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-e8cf251744f0\",\"rationale\":\"Steep-end point at gamma -3.48 with b=1.265.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.265,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.48},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":286600,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests the combined benefit of D and b at the steep end.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-e8cf251744f0\",\"rationale\":\"Steep-end point at gamma -3.52, b=1.25; g about 11.87.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.52},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":288400,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.8,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Should dominate C-e8cf251744f0 (288430, 394.06) slightly.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-e8cf251744f0\",\"rationale\":\"Steepest safe point, gamma -3.55 with b=1.265; g about 11.92.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.265,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.55},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":288500,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Pushes the low-T end of the front while staying under g=12.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-e8cf251744f0\",\"rationale\":\"Steepest point near the g limit, gamma -3.58 with b=1.25 (g about 11.97).\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.25,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.58},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":290000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.2,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Locates the g-constraint boundary and the lowest achievable T.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0}]}","ttft_ms":135328,"type":"result","duration_ms":186215,"uuid":"7befdb8f-309a-4fed-a8e1-45bfbc49eb59","ttft_stream_ms":1451,"time_to_request_ms":30,"first_content_frame_ms":1451,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
